WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
Aria is a calm vehicle companion. She welcomes a named driver and offers to help without taking control.

00:10.000 --> 00:30.000
The onboarding covers safety first, then lock and unlock, charging, climate, and energy.

00:30.000 --> 01:02.000
Family profiles let a shared car feel personal. Guidance stays available; the driver stays in charge.
